<http://www.example.org/emdso> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://www.example.org/emdso> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-04-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
