<http://www.example.org/emdso> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://www.example.org/emdso> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ontology modeling the European catalogue of high-risk medical devices and in vitro diagnostics under MDR (EU 2017/745) and IVDR (EU 2017/746), including devices, manufacturers, risks, incidents and field safety corrective actions (FSCA)."@en .
<http://www.example.org/emdso> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EUDAMED Medical Device and IVD Safety Ontology"@en .
<http://www.example.org/emdso> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0" .
